%% Administrator High-Level Sequence Diagram-Manage User Accounts
sequenceDiagram
    actor Administrator
    participant System as Event Management System

    Administrator->>System: Select a user account and submit a management action
    System->>System: Verify administrator authorization
    alt Administrator is authorized
        System->>System: Update the selected user account
        System-->>Administrator: Confirm the account update
    else Administrator is not authorized
        System-->>Administrator: Deny the account management request
    end
